## mochiOS Libraries Build Environment ##

This repository maintains the build infrastructure and library definitions
for third-party libraries targeting mochiOS.

It provides a centralized environment for tracking upstream releases,
resolving dependencies, cross-compiling libraries, verifying build results,
and distributing packages for mochiOS.

Repository structure
-----------------------------------------

  libraries.toml     Library definitions and dependencies
  recipes/           Library-specific build configurations
  tools/             Build and release management scripts
  tooling/           Shared build and verification utilities
  tests/             Infrastructure tests
  sdk.lock.toml      mochiOS SDK configuration
  sources.lock.json  Upstream source revision lockfile

Contributing
-----------------------------------------

Contributions are welcome!

You can contribute by proposing new libraries, adding library ports,
improving existing build recipes, or fixing issues in the build infrastructure.

To request support for a new library, open an issue at:
  https://github.com/mochiOS/libs/issues

For contribution guidelines, see 'contributing' file.

Licenses
-----------------------------------------

Libraries distributed through this repository retain their respective upstream
licenses. License notices are included in the corresponding library packages.
